# Node
node_modules/

# NOTE: dist/styles.css is deliberately committed, matching advanced-modern.
# Render's static service does not reliably run `npm run build`, and a missing
# dist/styles.css takes the whole site down to unstyled HTML. Committing it means
# the deploy never depends on the build succeeding. Rebuild and commit it
# whenever src/input.css, tailwind.config.js, or classes in index.html change.

